            "title": "The play button is pink, or the player looks dead",
            "content": "<p>That’s usually travel mode, which locks the buttons. Hold − and + together for a second until you hear a tone and the play button turns blue. <a href=\"/pages/quick-fixes#light-pink\">More about the lights</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_02": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I charge my player?",
            "content": "<p>Use the USB-C cable that came with it and a USB wall plug, like a phone charger. The battery light flashes green while it charges. A full charge gives up to 16 hours of listening. <a href=\"/pages/player-guide#charging\">Charging</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_03": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my order arrive?",
            "content": "<p>We dispatch orders the next working day. Standard UK delivery takes 2 to 3 working days from dispatch, and premium 1 to 2. <a href=\"/pages/delivery-and-returns#delivery\">Delivery</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_04": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I return my player?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Players and starter packs bought from our website have a 100-day Happiness Guarantee: send it back in its original packaging for a full refund, and we’ll email you a prepaid label. <a href=\"/pages/delivery-and-returns#happiness-guarantee\">Our guarantee</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_05": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "My player has stopped working",
            "content": "<p>Try the <a href=\"/pages/quick-fixes\">quick fixes</a> first: most things are a button press. If it still isn’t right, tell us. Within 2 years we repair or replace it and pay the postage both ways, and we repair players for life after that.</p>"
